  "F1 blocker: G2 new_file on per-session /tmp/dbus-<random> -> no soaked candidate can ever be KEEP; with that normaliser rule r03-r10 are KEEP (Delta -10.3..-10.7%, G7 share 0.99-1.03, soak 300/300 each, spots non-inferior).",
